   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S4-59 Sich Enviro entrepen&#xf6;rst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S4-59 Sich Enviro entrepreneurial support - Innovation Against Poverty S4-59 Sich Enviro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett projekt f&#xf6;r att producera billigare och milj&#xf6;v&#xe4;nligare kvalitet br&#xe4;nsle (bensin, fotogen, diesel) f&#xf6;r generatorer,           dieselbr&#xe4;nnare / kaminer, pannor, fordon etc. genom katalytisk omvandling av avfall / d&#xe4;ck och andra icke-nedbrytbara polymeravfall. Avtalspart &#xe4;r SichEnviro-energy Engineering Solutions (SEES), org.nr 190244, Zambia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project to produce cheaper and greener quality fuel (petrol, Kerosene, Diesel) for generators, diesel burners/stoves,     boilers, vehicles etc. through the catalytic conversion  of waste/tyres and other non-biogradable polymer waste. Agreement partner is SichEnviro-energy Engineering Solutions (SEES), org reg no 190244, Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
